Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never-ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.58,0:00:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, it's waiting\Nwhere we should be going. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're\Nshining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.42,0:01:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as well, so\Nlet's just stay with us, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.24,0:01:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.48,0:01:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one, go hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the\Nworld, just you wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.38,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.36,0:01:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.84,0:01:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,will find suspense And then commence to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:02:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Live out another day so intense.\NThat's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Open the map inside your\Nheart and see. No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,our mods will never give up There's a fire\Nin our dreams and you can never, never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.44,0:02:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never stop it We\Nwill be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.84,0:02:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've read your every thought\Nsince the moment we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.92,0:02:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackleg Sanji. No one can\Nhide from my all-seeing eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.88,0:02:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd heard you had a soft spot for women,\Nbut I didn't expect it to be that soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.86,0:02:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.40,0:02:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like a mess, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.60,0:02:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Some prince charming,\Ncovered in his own blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.28,0:03:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost pity you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.90,0:03:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a\Nfailure, Blackleg Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.80,0:03:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Be reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.14,0:03:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How would a worm like you win\Nthe heart of a woman like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you should have known our sis was\Nway too pretty to waste her time with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.60,0:03:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.54,0:03:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Violet, tell me it's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.48,0:03:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.14,0:03:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, get over it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.18,0:03:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She played you for a sap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.62,0:03:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all there is to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.04,0:03:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep down, you have a beautiful,\Ngood heart. I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.94,0:03:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you say such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.00,0:03:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,After all this...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,On your feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.88,0:03:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone must have put you up to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.64,0:03:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even want to be a\Npart of it, do you, Violet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.76,0:03:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You still think this is\Nsome kind of love story?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.24,0:04:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.88,0:04:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.39,0:04:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I was pretty cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,She kicked the crap out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're only pretending to care about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,When really you're looking\Nfor a chance to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.76,0:04:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly think you\Ncan fool me with your lies?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.48,0:04:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I ate the Glare Glare\NFruit. Thanks to that, I've
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,become well quite\Nobservant i can see through
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.16,0:04:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,anything now you men\Nare all liars let me see
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.92,0:04:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,inside your mind not\Nthat anything in it will
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.34,0:04:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,be worth a damn why did\NStraw Hat join up with
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.06,0:04:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,law what do they hope\Nto do what brings you to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.40,0:05:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,dress rosa besides the\Nceaser trade-off in green
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.32,0:05:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,bit answer my questions\Nand don't you dare lie
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't have to speak if you won't\Ntell me i'll just look inside your mind
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.10,0:05:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll locate all your crewmates\Nas well hey she's doing the pose
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.26,0:05:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sis, what did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.62,0:05:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.16,0:05:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.12,0:05:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.86,0:05:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,His mind is totally pink!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.98,0:05:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like it! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.24,0:05:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you up to, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.98,0:05:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your purpose here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.34,0:05:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What could you possibly be\Nthinking about at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.76,0:05:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't begin to fathom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.20,0:05:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.16,0:06:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,About the way you looked at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.58,0:06:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a man there—I\Nneed you to kill for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.82,0:06:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.66,0:06:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,knew that you weren't lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.60,0:06:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.90,0:06:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,matter what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what anyone says.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.68,0:06:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,For
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.72,0:06:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,me, a girl's tears are always enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.02,0:06:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,enough
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.54,0:06:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy must think\Nhe's in a romance novel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.56,0:06:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never heard such cheesy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.88,0:06:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, there's desperate,\Nand then there's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.72,0:06:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.64,0:06:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't get it. Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.94,0:06:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,if you're done with this delusional moron,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.08,0:06:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,we'd be more than happy\Nto finish him off for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.74,0:06:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's worth $77 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.28,0:06:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's the end\Nof Blackleg Sanjeev.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.66,0:06:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Karoo lagrima!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.78,0:07:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, lady? Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.24,0:07:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You serious, you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.58,0:07:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.08,0:07:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You were forced to work with\NDoflamingo, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.70,0:07:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to get away\Nfrom here, Black Lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.34,0:07:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about you? How could\NI... I'm fine! Forget me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.90,0:07:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way your plan will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.10,0:07:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're walking straight into a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You are trying to protect\None of your own enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.54,0:07:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.54,0:07:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why you believed\Nin me, but thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.02,0:08:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It made me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.86,0:08:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know the whole story here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.70,0:08:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but if you don't want to work\Nfor doflamingo, then leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.22,0:08:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You already attacked your own men—just\Ncome with me, and we'll escape together!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.18,0:08:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look into my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.36,0:08:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Black leg, from the moment you came here\Nwith Caesar—your crew's fate was sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.18,0:08:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is following doflamingo's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.52,0:08:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,His plan, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.24,0:08:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaze into my mind, and\Nyou will understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.12,0:08:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,will understand
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.32,0:08:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's my memory of\NDressrosa this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.64,0:08:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.36,0:08:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't really be quitting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.66,0:08:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,An explanation at least!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What would ever make you\Nabdicate from the throne?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.18,0:08:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.06,0:08:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They should have arrived by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.24,0:09:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Warship?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.90,0:09:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're heading for the harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.98,0:09:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.60,0:09:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that emblem, but\NI can't place where?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.82,0:09:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's from Cypher Pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.44,0:09:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just zero flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.24,0:09:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The government officials who work under\Nthe world nobles—what are they doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.96,0:09:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Citizens of dress rosa, I ask\Nyou to remain calm and listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.84,0:09:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We've journeyed to your island to\Naddress rumors concerning doflamingo's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.78,0:09:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,abdication of the throne and\Nretirement from the seven warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.84,0:09:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a false report, simply a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.74,0:09:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And to let the rest of the world know,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.02,0:09:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll be releasing an extra\Nedition of the newspaper at 3 p .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:09:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,today, setting the record straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.02,0:10:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But it must be kept secret until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.82,0:10:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No one outside Dressrosa is to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.36,0:10:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Our top priority is for all\Nnations to keep living in peace,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.34,0:10:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,as if nothing has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I feel like everything just\Ngot turned upside down? The world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,government i know the warlords are\Npowerful but that kind of influence is too
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.42,0:10:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,much one would think so please go
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.74,0:10:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm too terrified of doflamingo to try
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,to leave dress rosa myself but maybe\Nyou and your friends can get away
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.98,0:10:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,in time what the hell should I do wow\Nthat's creepy were you hiding in the sand
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,listening in on us this entire time Nico\Nno this is just a clone of my body was that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.94,0:10:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,song you were talking to on the transponder\Nsnail just now first if this isn't your
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:11:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,actual body where are\Nyou and the nose second
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.02,0:11:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,off if what Blackleg was saying is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The deal with Doflamingo is off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.24,0:11:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, off?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what about you handing me over?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.36,0:11:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Beniko, find the nose and let's\Nhurry up and get off this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,One problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here on Greenbit, but Usopp\Nand I are currently both underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.06,0:11:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We fell into a bit of\Ntrouble and got tied up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But to make a long story\Nshort, we're safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.12,0:11:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't help you, but if you're\Ngoing to escape, go without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.02,0:11:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,When we get the opportunity, we'll leave\Nand catch up with you at the harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.52,0:11:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.08,0:11:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not the Navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.76,0:11:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.06,0:11:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Right back at ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.56,0:12:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Joker!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.68,0:12:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.26,0:12:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to admit it, but\Nyou've managed to impress me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.70,0:12:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Must have taken some effort to get\Nan actual Navy Admiral to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And since I'm no longer a warlord,\NI'm really shaking in my boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.60,0:12:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a damn liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.70,0:12:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time. All competitors in block C.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.14,0:12:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,have taken the stage 139 warriors in total
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.48,0:12:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,it's our third battle\Nroyale of the day who
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.42,0:12:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,will be the last one standing in the ring
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.58,0:13:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you get down to the ring\Nwithout me seeing you get back here
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.34,0:13:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're inflecting? Are you trying\Nto get down on the hands, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.72,0:13:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,An extra addition?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be a correction or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.60,0:13:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this garbage?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.76,0:13:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, you need to see this! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's big news about Doflamingo. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all a mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.00,0:13:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How could it be just an error?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.66,0:14:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You use the authority\Nof the world government
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.80,0:14:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,for some trick You\Nspread a false story and
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.24,0:14:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,to see people all over\Nthe whole damn world
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.38,0:14:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,just to gain an advantage\Nover our small group
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,haven't you ever seen a magic show\Nthe greatest delusions are often
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.40,0:14:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,pulled off with the simplest of\Ntricks law everyone always says well
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.02,0:14:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,that's ridiculous but it's the rigidity\Nof the mind assuming no one would
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,go to such lengths that creates the\Nblind spot in humans you're just a
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.92,0:14:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,pirate it doesn't matter if you're\None of the seven warlords it doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.66,0:14:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,even matter that you're a king you\Ndon't have that much influence to make
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.34,0:14:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone believe in an illusion to\Nlie to the whole world that power
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.78,0:14:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't exist and there's no one alive\Nwho could ever pull it off that is
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.10,0:15:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,except for the celestial dragons you don't
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.66,0:15:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,know as much about\Njoker's past as you should
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.78,0:15:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're going to pay with\Nyour life for that ignorance
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me, you're a...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.70,0:15:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too complicated to explain right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.04,0:15:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.94,0:15:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I just really wanted to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.08,0:15:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Joker!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.99,0:15:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Make him pay for this! Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.48,0:15:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way in hell you're\Ngetting Caesar back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.20,0:15:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I had an agreement!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.60,0:15:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just do what you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.48,0:15:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The deal's off, Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.18,0:15:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna regret this decision!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.71,0:15:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because you're screwed doesn't\Nmean you have to drag me down with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.72,0:15:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We've hardly spoken in ten\Nyears, and this is how you act?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.96,0:16:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Treat your old boss nicer, won't you, Law?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar is very valuable to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.16,0:16:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to have him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.32,0:16:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Isho, it would appear that Lyle brought\NCaesar Clown here for a trade-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.44,0:16:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the scientist that caused\Nthe poison gas incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.54,0:16:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A heinous crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.08,0:16:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.64,0:16:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If he works for one of the seven\Nwarlords, he'll get amnesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.76,0:16:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.22,0:16:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.62,0:16:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the famous vice-admiral who got\Nrecruited in the World Military Draft,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.86,0:16:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.58,0:16:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Fujitoro, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.16,0:16:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They say you and Vice\NAdmiral Ryokyugyu are both
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.88,0:16:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,forces to be reckoned\Nwith on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you flatter me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You can spare me the humble act.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.66,0:16:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll be frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.94,0:16:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm having some trouble\Nunraveling the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I don't have much\Nexperience as a Marine,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.22,0:16:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,so I don't want to make\Nany baseless accusations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.54,0:16:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But it seems to me, as a warlord,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.08,0:17:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you're doing some things that step\Noutside of your boundaries just a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.36,0:17:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,For example,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.62,0:17:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the fellow over there just referred to you\Nas Joker, a rather troubling implication.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.02,0:17:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to dig into my past, you'd\Nbetter be willing to get your hands dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,because it'll take a mountain\Nof evidence to topple me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.72,0:17:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of naughty warlords,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.80,0:17:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,what's the Navy going to do about law?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.72,0:17:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're referring to the news about his\Nalliance with the infamous pirate Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.38,0:17:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If the reports are true,\Nthen I'm afraid he's guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.16,0:17:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me: law, is he simply\Nyour subordinate or is he an ally?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.56,0:17:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're guilty—what comes\Nnext depends on your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.90,0:17:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you betrayed your position.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.70,0:17:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,position will have to arrest both you\Nand the Straw Hats for your crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.32,0:17:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of half-assed decision is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.08,0:17:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All he has to do is lie and\Nyou let him go scot-free?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.14,0:18:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My plan fell completely apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.50,0:18:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy shows up and now I'm the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.14,0:18:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let the team in\NDressrosa be affected by this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.48,0:18:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to\Nmake a stand on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.44,0:18:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lying won't help. It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.96,0:18:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats aren't working under me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.94,0:18:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We're equals in this alliance!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.00,0:18:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just can't take the easy way, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.28,0:18:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.62,0:18:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your title is revoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.32,0:18:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But that might not be the\Nonly headline tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.94,0:18:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Meteor? That...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,that can't be right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.86,0:19:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a bit overkill, don't\Nyou think? It's a meteor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,One more gazillion!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.92,0:19:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.80,0:19:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.60,0:19:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.22,0:19:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Happened where's he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.98,0:19:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Show Joker seems they survived
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.80,0:19:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,though I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.71,0:20:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,say how the.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.20,0:20:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Only thing left are the spots\Nthey're standing on is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.52,0:20:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How the Navy acts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.43,0:20:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now show some restraint—are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.42,0:20:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a blind man won't miss\Nwith an attack that big!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.00,0:20:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, pardon me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.24,0:20:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Law, you're a criminal; therefore,\NI'll be arresting you now. I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.62,0:20:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,was
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.22,0:20:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,falling
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.48,0:20:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.88,0:20:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, ain't that sweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.52,0:20:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh hey, I think I can find the\Nfactory—easy for real, yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.72,0:20:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Problem is we can't just wreck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.32,0:20:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,wreck it Get the whole ass out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.54,0:20:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.38,0:20:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A whole big thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you filthy little thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.72,0:20:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you we don't take credit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.94,0:20:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody stop that toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.82,0:20:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He took my burgers and didn't pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.58,0:21:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be lucky just to\Nmake it out alive now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.36,0:21:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard about Doflamingo's trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.90,0:21:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, we walked right into that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.84,0:21:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But just cause our fancy\Nplan went off the rails
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.06,0:21:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't mean we can't do some\Ndamage while we're in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.40,0:21:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I got something brewing here that\Nmight salvage this operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.88,0:21:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.22,0:21:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just meet me at the flower\Nfield and we'll work things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.76,0:21:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that place anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.56,0:21:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like something\Nout of a fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I'm getting\Nworried about Nami. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.98,0:21:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami's tough as nails.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.36,0:21:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.52,0:21:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.74,0:21:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, she got broken\Nmonster chopper with her too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.78,0:21:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, something up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.36,0:21:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they watching there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.98,0:21:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's green.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.89,0:21:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,They broadcast from the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.72,0:21:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The newcomer Luffy is putting\Non a spoiler show today!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.84,0:21:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Love that beard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.04,0:21:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's small, but quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.00,0:21:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, I found Luffy, and he's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.96,0:22:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's fighting in\Nsome big tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.20,0:22:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.60,0:22:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you do anything to stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.62,0:22:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't trust him on his own!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.28,0:22:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're in no position to judge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.18,0:22:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackleg, I have to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.50,0:22:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.72,0:22:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My men.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.68,0:22:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You and your crew are trying to get\Nto Doflamingo's secret factory, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.38,0:22:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.29,0:22:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's disguised.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.42,0:22:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a toy house on the exterior.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.66,0:22:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's your target.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.88,0:22:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.30,0:22:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you help me this much,\Nthere's no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.88,0:22:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late. I'm doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.16,0:22:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the executives already\Nknow that I betrayed the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.04,0:22:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Violet, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.04,0:22:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The Western Harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.72,0:22:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You can meet me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.40,0:22:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay hidden and wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.62,0:22:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our cruise rendezvous point.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.80,0:22:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear, I'll get you out, no\Nmatter what the cost may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.48,0:23:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.46,0:23:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.20,0:23:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, sir! Please fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.48,0:23:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be hopeless!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to ruin the mood!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.28,0:23:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.72,0:23:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Violet, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.88,0:23:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Defeat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.56,0:23:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.78,0:23:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.69,0:23:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just thugs. Why'd you need me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.26,0:23:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,They are holding my dear friend Congeno\Nhostage, so I was rendered helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, I am\Nin dire need of your aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.00,0:23:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We must make haste to the toy house.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.00,0:23:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I have heard word that this is where\Nthe fiends are holding Congeno,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.66,0:23:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't know the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.50,0:23:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck's going on up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.94,0:24:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be long.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.20,0:24:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.38,0:24:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If the roof caves in, then\Nwe're all going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.78,0:24:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.69,0:24:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the hero is scared now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.98,0:24:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.89,0:24:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That earthquake was caused by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.18,0:24:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Or my Haki?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.36,0:24:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Haki?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.27,0:24:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how you beat up all 50,000 of those\Nbad guys back on Fishman Island, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.66,0:24:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.68,0:24:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.30,0:24:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so strong, you can\Nshake the whole kingdom, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.10,0:24:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Try this, hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.48,0:24:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A delicious gift!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.68,0:24:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A big piece of fighting fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.62,0:24:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're like goldfish, only angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.04,0:24:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Those big guys? Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.62,0:24:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.70,0:24:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't think it'd be so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.22,0:24:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost as tasty as Sea King, which\NI dine on all the time, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.98,0:24:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.28,0:24:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So they're the ones who nab\Nthat thing back on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.30,0:24:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,These little guys must be crazy strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.88,0:24:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad they're on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.40,0:25:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we're small,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.38,0:25:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,just one of those fighting fish could feed
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.06,0:25:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the whole kingdom for\Na month or even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.26,0:25:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You big people have to\Neat an awful lot, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.58,0:25:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be a real pain sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.86,0:25:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.34,0:25:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,For Lufilon and my Ushalon fighting\Nforce, a fish like this as just a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.94,0:25:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Usaland?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.52,0:25:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.68,0:25:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Look familiar to ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.62,0:25:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,From that picture book\Nwe read back in Jaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.14,0:25:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo, is that... Noland? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.68,0:25:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.42,0:25:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You know him, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.00,0:25:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the big person botanist who came\Nto visit our kingdom 400 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.22,0:25:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Our hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.44,0:25:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, there were a bunch\Nof bad guys messing up our home,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.74,0:25:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but Noland rushed to the aid of\Nour ancestors and saved the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.58,0:26:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never forget the debt we owe to\NNoland, no matter how many years pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.92,0:26:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Tumtada will always honor him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.60,0:26:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When Ursuline mentioned the hero's name\Nand told us he was one of his descendants,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.38,0:26:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.29,0:26:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so overwhelmed! No! I\Nmean it! Look at my helmet!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.72,0:26:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's shaped like a chestnut,\Njust like his head! He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.78,0:26:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A chestnut head!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.26,0:26:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We tied you up! It's awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.52,0:26:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry! You're shameless.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.24,0:26:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't complain, it saved you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.56,0:26:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep quiet, enjoy the feast,\Nand then we'll get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.60,0:26:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly, it must be an act of\Nfate that brought you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.66,0:26:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And today, no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.64,0:26:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.06,0:26:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,After 400 long years have passed, a\Nlegendary hero comes before us once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.24,0:26:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,on the very day that we vowed\Nto go to war against Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.76,0:26:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucelyn,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.68,0:26:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,after you finish eating,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.76,0:26:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll take the underground passage\Nto the flower field and prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.20,0:26:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.60,0:27:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain and his Rick royal army\Nare waiting for us in Dressrosa,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.90,0:27:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,where the final battle\Nwill be waged. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.08,0:27:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, take the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.24,0:27:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Usher us to freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.32,0:27:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Together, we'll crush the\NDon Quixote family! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.94,0:27:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,With Usaland, we're invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.68,0:27:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.84,0:27:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him a cheer!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.92,0:27:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Usa land, yeah!
